# tests/integration/
#
# Responsibility:
#   Cross-cutting integration and end-to-end tests that exercise multiple
#   services together (backend + database + redis + frontend).
#
#   These tests require a running Docker Compose stack and verify that
#   the full request flow works correctly from API call to database
#   persistence and back.
#
# Run:
#   docker compose up -d
#   cd tests/integration && pytest
